 "personal_evidence": false, "receipt_id": "MATH-ARCHIVE-d1fe620075076b8ceef05e96", "role": "raw_unadjudicated_not_new_wrong_cause", "selected_user_sequence": 1, "selection": "first_complete_user_turn", "status": "verified", "terminal_outcomes": ["wrong_recorded"], "user_turn_cache": "错题知识网络/个人知识点索引/source_cache/44fe66276f0d45fe6440e026792a803a864fe0692beddb388ec13037a623a1d3.users.json", "user_turn_cache_sha256": "44fe66276f0d45fe6440e026792a803a864fe0692beddb388ec13037a623a1d3", "user_turn_count": 3, "user_turn_provenance": [{"character_range": [0, 318], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": null, "raw_text_sha256": "7b7747ae56d911c53bc77ce70fa7a21be3ff7f3b6e74531caaa33f754be992dd", "role": "user", "sequence": 1}, {"character_range": [0, 108], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "440ca83e41c1019e4e6054de3f50927d7a87a0b12d3404fa13289206eff1a6a6", "role": "user", "sequence": 3}, {"character_range": [0, 18], "next_role": "assistant", "previous_role": "assistant", "raw_text_sha256": "92786c42e79fec56d5bb1cafb5d1c49c3aabaf90eaa788d576e002cfafa60104", "role": "user", "sequence": 5}]}, "source_kind": "accepted_conversation_excerpt", "text": "这道题我其实也不是完全无从下手。\n题目说这个平面过这个点，距离为 1。根据点到平面的距离公式：\\\n|Ax₀ + By₀ + Cz₀ + D| / √(A² + B² + C²) = 1\n这个我知道。然后它要求这个平面的方程。\n已知它过这条直线，这条直线是两个平面的交线：\\\n• 第一个平面的法向量是 (3, -2, 0)\\\n• 第二个平面的法向量是 (1, -2, -1)\\\n由此可以得到这条直线的方向向量是 (2, 3, -4)，对吧？\n如果能确认这条直线和这个平面的关系：比如直线垂直于平面，那我就可以把直线的方向向量当作平面的法向量，这样直接就能求出来了。但这道题并没有告诉我们直线与平面之间的明确关系，我卡在这里不知道该怎么做了"}